Z||000003||theogre||02-17-2001||12:19 AM||||Physically they may interchange.... Don't do it unless you have to. I've learned from personal experience that bypassing steering column safety devices is a pretty bad idea. <P>It's not quite so bad bypassing the manual key safety button but it's still not a good idea.||||reg||1
